 <h3><u>Karbobala naseeb se jaana naseeb ho</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span data-ft={ tn:k} class=userContent>Karbobala naseeb se jaana naseeb ho<br> <br> Karbobalaa naseeb se jaanaa naseeb ho<br> Phir lauT ke wahaaN se na aanaa naseeb ho<br> <br> Aisaa dar e hussain pe sajdaa ho aakhri<br> Phir mujhko apnaa sar na uthaanaa naseeb ho<br> <br> Parvardigaar <span class=text_exposed_show><br> thokareN dar dar ki kab talak<br> Kab mustaqil najaf meN Thikaanaa naseeb ho<br> <br> Jaisaa milaa naseeb se ummul baneen ko<br> Ab kyaa kisi ko aisaa gharaanaa naseeb ho<br> <br> Dil chaahtaa hai saamne baithey ho panjetan<br> Unki sanaa unhi ko sunaanaa naseeb ho<br> <br> AaNkhoN ko jab bhi ashq bahaanaa naseeb ho<br> Aal e nabi ke gham kaa bahaanaa naseeb ho<br> <br> Mehshar ye aarzoo hai ki be ghusl o be kafan<br> Karbobalaa ki teh meN samaanaa naseeb ho</span></span></p> 
